  "question": {
    "text": "The diagram shows a spherical surface which separates two media of refractive indices,&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>, respectively. Now, a point object is placed on the principal axis as shown in the figure. Then<br />\r<br />\r<img height=\"98\" src=\"assets\\qt0098_c3fd85833ee5.jpeg\" width=\"205\" />"
  },
  "options": [
